/* UI strings. Keys are the English text; keep every key in both en and zh-Hans. */

"Couldn’t safely coordinate file access: %@" = "无法安全协调文件访问：%@";
"Couldn’t write a temporary PDF. The original file is unchanged." = "无法写入临时 PDF。原文件未更改。";
"The PDF file can’t be read." = "无法读取 PDF 文件。";
"The file was changed by another app after it was opened. To protect those changes, it was not overwritten. Reopen the file before editing it again." = "文件在打开后已被其他程序修改。为保护对方的修改，本次没有覆盖文件。请重新打开文件后再编辑。";
"The temporary PDF failed verification. The original file is unchanged." = "临时 PDF 校验失败。原文件未更改。";
